# No co-author trailers, branding, or advertising

Never add attribution or promotional material for tools or assistants.

## Git commits

- Do not add `Co-authored-by:` (or similar trailer lines) to commit messages.
- Do not name or credit Cursor, Cursor Agent, “cursor-agent”, or any AI/assistant in commits.

## All other output

- Do not inject IDE, tool, or assistant branding into user-facing text, docs, comments, or generated artifacts unless the user explicitly asked for it.
- Do not add “Made with …”, “Built with …”, or similar promotional badges or footers.

## Examples

```text
# BAD (commit message footer)
Co-authored-by: Cursor <noreply@cursor.com>

# GOOD
(omit any Co-authored-by and any tool/assistant mention)
```

```html
<!-- BAD -->
<footer>Made with Cursor</footer>

<!-- GOOD -->
(no tool branding unless the user requested it)
```
